{"id":"vod_bf_32764","vodId":"32764","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"俗·再见，绝望先生","name_cn":"俗·再见，绝望先生","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-33/564166971b6f92635b394cf8c258c6bd.jpg"},"summary":"无论什么方面都很普通的少女日塔奈美假扮成不上学少女来到学校，却发现学校满是怪人。超乐观少女风浦可符香无论看什么都乐观积极；一板一眼死硬派少女木津千里在“不上学少女为何来学校”这一点与奈美纠缠不清；连班主任糸色望都不上课，忙着自杀。一直认为“普通这个词肯定不是好话”的普通少女奈美，在教室中反倒成了另类。　　的确，在被称为“绝望先生”的超消极老师糸色望的带领下，2年へ班全体32人都是有一点儿不正常的人。口头禅是“绝望了！对xx的世界觉悟了”的望，与学生们一起生活的爆笑校园喜剧就这样再次开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 14:54:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewangxiansheng/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/suzaijianjuewa